  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b4ae5e38c4837a4e5fad38036d4e9c4f5ec902325054f6f26e269365ad507296.png] \n\nLets check each option:\n\n1) ÷, +, ×, –, = \n\nBy replacing * with mathematical signs , we get:\n\n⇒ __**25 ÷ 5**__ + 10 × 2 - 8 \n\n⇒ 5 + __**10 × 2**__ - 8 \n\n⇒ __**5 + 20**__ - 8 \n\n⇒ __**25 - 8**__ = **17 **\n\n2) –, +, ÷, ×, =\n\nBy replacing * with mathematical signs , we get:\n\n⇒ 25 - 5 + __**10 ÷ 2**__ × 8\n\n⇒ 25 - 5 +__** 5 × 8**__\n\n⇒ __**25**__ - 5 __**+ 40**__\n\n⇒ __**65 - 5 **__= **60 ≠ 17**\n\n3) ×, ÷, –, +, =\n\nBy replacing * with mathematical signs , we get:\n\n⇒ 25 × __**5 ÷ 10**__ - 2 + 8 \n\n⇒ __**25 × 0.5**__ - 2 + 8 \n\n⇒ __**12.5**__ - 2 __**+ 8 **__\n\n⇒ __**20.5 - 2 **__= **18.5 ≠ 17**\n\n4) ÷, ×, –, +, =\n\nBy replacing * with mathematical signs , we get:\n\n⇒ __**25 ÷ 5**__ × 10 - 2 + 8 \n\n⇒ __**5 × 10**__ - 2 + 8 \n\n⇒ __**50**__ - 2 __**+ 8**__ \n\n⇒ __**58 - 2**__ = **56 ≠ 17**\n\nHence,** 'option 1'** is the correct answer.",
